---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import img17 from '../assets/images/17.png';
import img6 from '../assets/images/6.png';
import img74 from '../assets/images/74.png';
import belleHeadshot from '../assets/images/belle-headshot.jpg';
import blueIvoryPurpleCorners from '../assets/images/blue-ivory-purple-corners.png';
import gradient2 from '../assets/images/gradient-2.png';
import img1260 from '../assets/images/img-1260.jpg';
import jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios86 from '../assets/images/jphelloseoheadshots0626-staborstudios-86.jpg';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
---

<Layout title="Meet the Team | HelloSEO" description="Learn about HelloSEO's expert team dedicated to enhancing your digital presence through SEO, paid ads, and digital PR. Connect with us today for tailored strategies." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} headerTheme="white">
  <Section theme="white" height="small" bg={{ src: img74, overlay: 0.82, focal: '37.8% 80%', parallax: true, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [25, 16], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="2/2/5/10" d="3/14/7/24" z={1}>
      <h1>Searching for help takes enough <span class="c-lightAccent">courage</span>.</h1>
    </Text>
    <Text m="5/2/16/10" d="7/14/14/24" z={2} alignM="center">
      <p>There's nothing more discouraging than gathering up the nerve to find a therapist, only to hit a digital wall of ill-fitting results that don't offer what you need.</p>
      <p><strong>HelloSEO serves as the matchmaker between the modalities you do best and the people actively seeking that support, at the exact moment they're seeking it.</strong></p>
      <p>By growing your practice, we expand access to meaningful mental health support that serves you, your clients, and the larger community. When this work is done well, everyone wins.</p>
    </Text>
    <Img m="17/6/25/10" d="1/6/10/11" z={4} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios86} alt="A woman with light skin, brown hair, wearing a black dress with buttons, standing next to a wooden chair, against a plain cream-colored wall." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 21vw" eager />
    <Img m="17/2/25/6" d="5/3/16/9" z={3} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={img17} alt="Bright dining room with open window, wooden table with green glassware, and green chairs, decorated with potted plants and artwork on the walls." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 25vw" eager />
    <Img m="23/1/26/3" d="12/8/14/10" z={5} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 2, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }] }] }} src={gradient2} alt="Simplified illustration of a smiling cat with closed eyes, a small nose, and a curled tail, on a dark background." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 25vw, 8vw" eager />
  </Section>

  <Section theme="bright-inverse" bg={{ src: blueIvoryPurpleCorners }} grid={{ rows: [20, 16], rowGap: 11, colGap: 26 }}>
    <Text m="3/2/5/10" d="3/10/5/18" z={1} align="center">
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-lightAccent"><strong>AWARD WINNING SEO AND AEO AGENCY</strong></span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="6/2/9/10" d="5/6/7/22" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.1, sy: 1.1 }] }] }}>
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">2024 National Excellence Award Winner, USA</span></h3>
    </Text>
    <Img m="6/1/9/2" d="5/6/7/22" z={8} zm={12} align="center" anim={{ base: { o: 0 }, animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{}, {}] }] }} opacity={0} src={img6} alt="Icon of a trophy with a star in the center." fit="contain" position="left" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 13vw, 67vw" />
    <Text m="9/2/12/10" d="7/6/9/22" z={4} zm={5} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.1, sy: 1.1 }] }] }} radius="10px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="highlight"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.conductor.com/events/digital-transformation-summit-2024/wis/"><span class="c-darkAccent"><em>Conductor’s Women in Search</em></span></a></span><span class="c-darkAccent"><em>, nominee, 2023 and 2024 </em></span></h3>
    </Text>
    <Img m="9/10/12/11" d="7/6/9/22" z={12} zm={16} align="center" anim={{ base: { o: 0 }, animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{}, {}] }] }} opacity={0} src={img6} alt="Outline of a trophy with a star in the center, on a black background." fit="contain" position="right" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 13vw, 67vw" />
    <Text m="12/2/15/10" d="9/6/11/22" z={5} zm={7} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.1, sy: 1.1 }] }] }} radius="10px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">2023 Local Excellence Winner, Columbia, SC</span></h3>
    </Text>
    <Img m="12/1/15/2" d="9/6/11/22" z={9} zm={13} align="center" anim={{ base: { o: 0 }, animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{}, {}] }] }} opacity={0} src={img6} alt="Line drawing of a trophy with a star in the center and two handles on either side, in orange on a black background." fit="contain" position="left" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 13vw, 67vw" />
    <Text m="15/2/17/10" d="11/6/13/22" z={6} zm={9} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.1, sy: 1.1 }] }] }} radius="10px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent"><em>Upcity 2023 Best of South Carolina</em></span></h3>
    </Text>
    <Img m="15/10/17/11" d="11/6/13/22" z={11} zm={15} align="center" anim={{ base: { o: 0 }, animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{}, {}] }] }} opacity={0} src={img6} alt="Outline of a trophy with a star in the center and two handles." fit="contain" position="right" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 13vw, 67vw" />
    <Text m="17/2/19/10" d="13/6/15/22" z={7} zm={11} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.1, sy: 1.1 }] }] }} radius="10px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Upcity 2022 Best of South Carolina</span></h3>
    </Text>
    <Img m="17/1/19/2" d="13/6/15/22" z={10} zm={14} align="center" anim={{ base: { o: 0 }, animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{}, {}] }] }} opacity={0} src={img6} alt="Outline of a trophy with a star in the center on a black background." fit="contain" position="left" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 13vw, 67vw" />
  </Section>

  <Section grid={{ rows: [39, 21], rowGap: 0, colGap: 30 }}>
    <Img m="3/2/21/10" d="4/3/22/12" z={6} zm={5} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'appear', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ x: '179px' }, {}] }, { trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ r: -4 }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={belleHeadshot} alt="A young woman with shoulder-length light brown hair, wearing a pearl headband and a white textured jacket, sitting in a well-lit, elegant interior with mirrors, plants, and hanging lamps." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 38vw" />
    <Text m="22/2/40/10" d="7/14/19/25" z={3} zm={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h1>Belle Gordon</h1>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-lightAccent"><strong>SEO SPECIALIST</strong></span></p>
      <p>Belle is a University of South Carolina graduate working and living in abroad. She helps clients with everything from technical SEO and on-page optimization to content strategy and schema markup. Her goal is simple: helping clients perform better in search. </p>
      <p>She’s embracing what it means to be a digital nomad, pursuing a career she loves all while exploring different cultures and lifestyles abroad. </p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section grid={{ rows: [47, 29], rowGap: 0, colGap: 30 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/20/10" d="3/15/21/24" z={6} zm={5} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'appear', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ x: '179px' }, {}] }, { trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ r: 4 }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={img1260} alt="A woman with long curly red hair smiling in a cozy living room with brick walls, a map, and lamps." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 38vw" />
    <Text m="21/2/41/10" d="5/3/18/14" z={3} zm={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h1>Mia Gates</h1>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-lightAccent"><strong>BUSINESS OPERATIONS &amp; GROWTH COORDINATOR</strong></span></p>
      <p>Mia’s work spans marketing and content, executive support, business development, and the day-to-day operations that help keep a growing business moving. She works closely with Jade to manage projects, support client and partner relationships, develop marketing initiatives, and help build systems that make the business run smoothly. </p>
      <p>She’s a recent College of Charleston grad with a passion for marketing, technology, and AI. She loves getting to wear a lot of different hats, solve problems, and turn ideas into something real!</p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="43/2/45/10" d="24/11/26/17" z={7} zm={6} align="center" href="/contact">Let’s Work Together</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
